  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protection and Assistance to Vulnerable Haitian Women and Children Migrants</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project aims at reinforcing safety, addressing protection risks, promoting economic growth, and contributing to restoring the human dignity of repatriated migrants and community members along the border with the Dominican Republic, and in the areas of origin with a specific focus on women and children to reduce poverty and improve the living conditions of the Haitian population. The project will also contribute to combat human trafficking and protect internal and cross-border vulnerable migrants -especially women and children- from violence, exploitation and abuse.</narrative>
  </description>
